+8.  **Advance:** Update $\mathbf{p} \leftarrow \mathbf{p} + \mathbf{s}$. Re-evaluate boundary check. Repeat until $NumSamples$ is reached or ray exits.
+9.  **Output:** Return $\mathbf{dst}$.
 
